wered and that i can face  anything  looking to the future i have this  ambition that what i will do  will have a purpose higher than me and  serve society  working on ai is the answer to that it  can be applied to so many of the  problems that we face  like finding a solution to climate  change or improving health care  for anyone that is thinking about  applying i will say do it  don't underestimate the potential that  you have and the value of your unique  background  there is no one else like you out there  i am a deepmind scholar
 

